@startuml
title 企业文件管理系统 - 文件上传（直传）时序图（2025-11-17）

actor 用户 as User
participant "浏览器/文件列表页\n(List.vue)" as UI
participant "Axios\nrequest.js" as Axios
participant "文件控制器\nFileController" as Ctrl
participant "文件服务\nFileService" as Svc
participant "系统设置服务\nSystemSettingService" as Setting
participant "用户服务\nUserService" as UserSvc
database "UserRepository" as UserRepo
database "FolderRepository" as FolderRepo
database "FileRepository" as FileRepo
participant "文件系统\n(FS)" as FS
participant "审计日志\nAuditLogService" as Audit

User -> UI: 选择文件并点击上传
UI -> Axios: POST /api/files/upload\nAuthorization: Bearer <token>\nfile, folderId?
Axios -> Ctrl: uploadFile(file, folderId)
Ctrl -> UserSvc: getUserIdByUsername(token.subject)
Ctrl -> Svc: uploadFile(file, userId, folderId)

group 策略/配额与校验
Svc -> Setting: isUploadAllowAll()
alt allowAll=false
  Svc -> Setting: getAllowedSuffixes()
  alt 后缀不在白名单/为空
    Svc --> Ctrl: 抛出 400 { message }
    Ctrl --> Axios: 400 { message }
    Axios --> UI: 提示失败
    return
  end
end
Svc -> UserRepo: tryUseQuota(userId, file.size)
alt 预占失败(空间不足)
  Svc --> Ctrl: 抛出 400 { message }
  Ctrl --> Axios: 400 { message }
  Axios --> UI: 提示存储不足
  return
end
end

group 写盘与记录
Svc -> FS: ensureDir(storagePath/user_<id>)
Svc -> FS: 流式写入文件并计算SHA-256
Svc -> FolderRepo: findByIdAndUserIdAndDeletedFalse(folderId, userId)
alt 目标文件夹无权限/不存在
  Svc --> Ctrl: 抛出 400 { message }
  Ctrl --> Axios: 400 { message }
  Axios --> UI: 提示失败
  return
end
Svc -> FileRepo: save(File{path,hash,size,owner,...})
Svc -> Audit: logSuccess(UPLOAD)
end

Ctrl --> Axios: 200 { fileId, filename, size, uploadTime }
Axios --> UI: 刷新列表并提示成功

@enduml

